   "widgets_values": [
    "# 03b · MiniMax H3 — long single clip (12.2 s)\nSame settings as 03 (768×960, turbo 8-step, euler, shift 8) with a longer timed shot list.\n**length = 294** frames (rule 17k+5; trained range ≈ 124–362 = 5–15 s).\n\n**Measured (RTX 5070 Ti 16 GB / 62 GB RAM):** RTX 5070 Ti 16 GB, ComfyUI 0.42.4 · 768×960 · 8 steps · shift 8: **6 s/141 f 219 s · 9 s/226 f 434 s · 12 s/294 f 694 s** (all beats, mid-clip sharpness ≈ 810–870) · 15 s/362 f 956 s (end goes soft, background drifts) · peak VRAM 15.5–15.6 GB, system RAM 54–59 GB. **Practical local max ≈ 12 s; 9 s = best quality/time; longer → chain with 03c.**\nSee `learning/minimax-h3-local.md` → *Video length limits* for the full table.\n\nShot-list tip: one beat per 1.5–2.5 s; give every beat a time range; keep the appearance/background locks."
   ]
